      "sourceTextSha256": "77c9d68dacf63575b2c419f8065d0d964b337e9cdb02a5b3d542e0c975a2e41c",
      "text": "Breakfast and transfer to the airport for your flight to Cusco; reception and transfer to the hotel. In the afternoon, climb to the Archaeological Park of Sacsayhuamán in the upper part of Cusco: Tambomachay, a spring believed to have been a place of worship; Q’enqo, a stone labyrinth with a sacrificial altar carved into the rock; the fortress of Sacsayhuamán, with its massive stones and a wonderful view over Cusco; and the Puka Pukara watchtower, before returning to the city and your hotel.",
